# ============================================================
#  Composite free energy  --  STEP 2 of 2
#  DLPNO-CCSD(T)/CBS accurate electronic energy on the
#  geometry optimized in step 1. No dispersion here: CCSD(T)
#  already describes it.
#  Verified runnable on ORCA 6.1.1.
#
#  Reads step1.xyz (rename to your step-1 .xyz output).
#  Report  G = E_elec(this job) + dG_therm(step 1)
# ============================================================
! DLPNO-CCSD(T) Extrapolate(3/4,cc) AutoAux TightSCF

%maxcore 3000

* xyzfile 0 1 step1.xyz
